(text "R7/R8 values TBD. P12 EN / trim retain existing settings, not modeled here.\nP12 common GND is the local switched return, NOT GND_SYS.\nJZ-MOS internal topology and 3.3 V trigger behavior require verification.\nDo not bypass the switch with test-instrument ground or added wiring.\nBuck capacitance may sustain output after MOS command goes LOW." (at 208.28 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid b6ccf4c5-55c2-5a9b-be58-5c6c2d0c1d45))
)
